付近は過去11回試されており、今回で12回目。支持線は試されるほど割れやすい（−5点・警戒）</div><div class=\"reason\">・50日線が200日線の上（ゴールデンクロス継続中の長期上昇形 +10点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・一目均衡表の雲の上（中期の地合いは良好 +4点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・夜間ギャップ（翌朝の窓開け）平均±0.4%と小さく、夜に決めた指値が翌朝も有効に働きやすい（+8点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・1日平均 1.5億円の売買（+6点）</div><div class=\"nhead\">減点方式: 全体268位（−10点）</div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>利確まで平均27日と資金拘束が長い<span class=\"num hp\">−5</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>直近の仮想買いが塩漬け中<span class=\"num hp\">−5</span></div><div class=\"nhead\">ファンダメンタル指標</div><div class=\"fact\"><span>配当利回り</span><span class=\"num\">1.63%</span></div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 3)\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 10)\">10年</button></span></div><div class=\"spark sp3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"71.5\" width=\"320\" height=\"10.200000000000003\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,85.5 6.1,81.2 8.3,77.0 10.4,83.6 12.5,88.8 14.7,81.2 16.8,84.7 19.0,83.9 21.1,87.2 23.2,91.5 25.4,91.1 27.5,76.8 29.6,79.7 31.8,79.2 33.9,77.0 36.1,90.0 38.2,90.0 40.3,81.3 42.5,69.5 44.6,72.7 46.7,79.8 48.9,76.5 51.0,77.0 53.2,53.7 55.3,65.8 57.4,56.0 59.6,59.4 61.7,46.5 63.8,42.2 66.0,30.6 68.1,28.6 70.2,23.7 72.4,29.5 74.5,40.5 76.7,35.8 78.8,12.8 80.9,28.0 83.1,34.4 85.2,43.6 87.3,30.3 89.5,31.4 91.6,22.7 93.8,28.0 95.9,28.3 98.0,31.6 100.2,26.5 102.3,35.4 104.4,53.6 106.6,74.3 108.7,51.2 110.8,44.4 113.0,43.7 115.1,50.9 117.3,54.3 119.4,49.8 121.5,60.2 123.7,59.4 125.8,65.4 127.9,69.4 130.1,69.5 132.2,70.9 134.4,75.2 136.5,71.8 138.6,65.9 140.8,62.3 142.9,64.7 145.0,62.3 147.2,62.4 149.3,69.4 151.5,71.1 153.6,68.3 155.7,65.8 157.9,64.4 160.0,60.8 162.1,73.1 164.3,72.5 166.4,71